{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>L.O.S.T.</strong> is an intense cooperative survival action game where up to four players are trapped in a deadly location.<br>Your only chance is to complete the mission, hold back enemy waves, and survive until evacuation arrives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every session is unique: your teamwork and decisions will determine whether you make it out alive \u2014 or remain forever lost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>4-player online co-op</strong> \u2014 survive together with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude81 <strong>Different escape scenarios</strong> \u2014 refuel a helicopter, repair a ship, or reach the bus in time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Fight enemy hordes</strong> \u2014 use weapons, abilities, and tactics to push back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd26 <strong>Scavenge &amp; cooperate</strong> \u2014 gather supplies, repair transport, and protect your team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd52 <strong>Fast-paced sessions</strong> \u2014 time is limited, and every choice matters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 Add <strong>L.O.S.T.</strong> to your wishlist and be among the first to experience the thrill of survival!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3919380?t=1766518709","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3919380?t=1766518709","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919380/55a68d0805d514d591d34f03842bf07c51347ce2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766518709","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919380/55a68d0805d514d591d34f03842bf07c51347ce2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766518709","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"